# Descriptor: [B- -> D'_10 l- nu, D'_10 -> D0 eta] gap mode (resonant)
# NickName: Bu_Dp1lnu_DEta_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode study; D'_1 -> D eta using wide PHSP sub-decay.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260429

Alias Dp1eta0sig D'_10
Alias anti-Dp1eta0sig anti-D'_10
ChargeConj Dp1eta0sig anti-Dp1eta0sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 Dp1eta0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 Dp1eta0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

Decay Dp1eta0sig
1.0 D0 eta PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-Dp1eta0sig

End
